  "description": "Pixel-art theme with Nai: vanilla-style frames and a picture of Nai inside every main button. On buttons with an icon she holds up an item that matches the button (a blueprint, a flask, a medkit...); on buttons without one she peeks out from behind a blackboard that the label sits on. Pictures are set for the base game's and expansions' buttons and for many mods' buttons; any other button gets the blackboard.",
